	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a creature</p><hr><p>This circular mark is meant to allow travelers to always find their way home. The target gains a +15-foot status bonus to their Speeds, but only when its movement would end closer to you than where the creature started its turn.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-runesmith-assistant.pf2e-runesmith-assistant-items.Item.RE2etiUSVzVOfJOc]{Effect: Zohk, Rune of Homecoming}</p><p><strong>Invocation</strong> (teleportation) You call the rune-bearer to your side. You teleport the target to any unoccupied square adjacent to you. If the bearer is unwilling, they can attempt a @Check[will||against:runesmith] save to negate the effect.</p>"
		},
